---
import JournalLayout from "../layouts/JournalLayout.astro";
---

<JournalLayout title="训练计划" subtitle="训练计划" activeTab="today" showSidebar={true} sidebarActive="plan">

  <article class="journal-card journal-card-pad journal-today-card" data-home-today>
    <div class="journal-today-top">
      <div class="journal-today-title">
        <p class="journal-section-kicker" data-today-kicker>周二 · 6 月 16 日</p>
        <a data-today-day-link href="/day" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;"><h2 data-today-title>轻松跑 40 分钟</h2></a>
        <div class="journal-inline-note" data-home-version></div>
      </div>
      <a class="journal-btn primary" href="/feedback">✓ 标记完成</a>
    </div>
    <div class="journal-workout-meta" data-today-badges>
      <span class="journal-badge">心率区间 2</span>
      <span class="journal-badge">配速 6'48" - 7'10"/km</span>
    </div>
    <div class="journal-callout" data-today-reason>
      本周第 2 个轻松日，巩固有氧基础。
    </div>
    <a class="journal-risk-line" href="/profile" data-today-risk hidden></a>
    <div class="journal-action-row">
      <a class="journal-btn" data-today-day-link href="/day">查看详细课表</a>
      <a class="journal-btn" href="/calendar">查看完整日历</a>
      <a class="journal-btn" href="/dialog">问 AI 教练</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="journal-card journal-card-pad" data-home-progress>
    <div class="journal-section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="journal-section-kicker">本周进度</p>
        <h2 data-progress-text>再练一次就满了</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="journal-progress-dots" data-progress-dots aria-label="本周进度">
        <span class="journal-progress-dot is-done"></span>
        <span class="journal-progress-dot is-done"></span>
        <span class="journal-progress-dot is-current"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <span class="journal-badge" data-progress-badge style="margin-bottom:12px;display:inline-block;">2 / 3 次训练</span>
    <div class="journal-session-list" data-home-session-list></div>
    <div class="journal-action-row" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <a class="journal-btn" href="/calendar">完整日历 →</a>
      <a class="journal-btn" href="/week-setup">重新生成计划</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="journal-card journal-card-pad" data-home-empty hidden>
    <div class="journal-empty">
      <strong>还没有训练计划</strong>
      <span>填写我的情况后生成。</span>
      <a class="journal-btn primary" href="/week-setup">生成训练计划</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</JournalLayout>
